Task TASK-ENGINE-DRUID-P1-1 is complete.

**Result:** Bug found and fixed at `engine/Engine/TriggerBus.cs` line 159-161. The `CollectAbilities` method was collecting `ON_TURN_START` triggers from BOTH players' artifacts for every turn start. This meant Book of Familiar summoned ROOTED tokens on EVERY turn (not just the owning player's turn), doubling the board-fill rate and creating a deadlock where all lanes filled with ROOTED tokens, preventing the Druid from playing real creatures or attacking.

**Fix:** Added `if (trigger != Trigger.ON_TURN_START)` guard at line 161 so only the current player's turn-start abilities fire.

